== Icelandic ==

=== Interjection ===

'''sæll og blessaður'''

# [[hello]], [[greetings]] (''greeting a single male person'')

===See also===
*[[sæl og blessuð]] (to greet a single female person or a mixed male/female group)
*[[sælir og blessaðir]] (to greet a group of male people)
*[[sælar og blessaðar]] (to greet a group of female people)

